    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10345" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιπερί-στᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>surrounding so as to compress,</i>
